<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa money mkt shortage 6.099 bln rand Tuesday.</title>
<headline>S.Africa money mkt shortage 6.099 bln rand Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Reserve Bank said Tuesday's money market shortage fell to 6.099 billion rand from Monday's adjusted total of 6.284 billion rand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
